Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.02,0:00:03.81,Note,0,0,0,0,,（忆往昔）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.34,0:00:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,查理 她在通过她的化名给托皮卡的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie … she's been making donations through her aliases.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.20,0:00:08.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,肖尼郡综合医院捐款\N{\fnArial\fs30}to Shawnee County General here in Topeka.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.79,0:00:09.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,做好事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like, a charity?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.79,0:00:11.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,给一个病人 叫格特鲁德·米德尔顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}A patient. Gertrude middleton.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.46,0:00:13.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,她和丈夫被酒驾司机撞到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She and her husband were hit by a drunk driver.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.16,0:00:16.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当时在外面过夜 我害怕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was at a sleepover, and I got scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.41,0:00:19.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打给我爸妈让他们来接我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I called my parents to come and get me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.08,0:00:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们那晚本不该开车出门的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They should never have been driving that night.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.00,0:00:22.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这东西必须得去掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}This thing has got to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.04,0:00:24.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,要去除其效力需要很强大的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}It will take a very powerful force to remove the effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.63,0:00:27.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就把它烧掉 我不要这么活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then burn it off! I'm not living like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.15,0:00:28.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,该隐仍然有血印 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cain still has the Mark, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.81,0:00:29.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一直带着它\N{\fnArial\fs30}So he's lived with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.78,0:00:31.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你有一部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe there's a part of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.26,0:00:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,想要向它投降\N{\fnArial\fs30}that wants to give in to it,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.80,0:00:34.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你得与之斗争\N{\fnArial\fs30}and maybe you have to fight that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.34,0:00:37.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,那一部分强大的力量得是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Part of that powerful force has to be you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.14,0:00:39.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,拯救他人 降妖除魔 家族事业\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saving people, hunting things, the family business?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.67,0:00:40.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这我懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am down.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.10,0:00:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 我的任务呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}But… Where's my quest?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.90,0:00:44.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,是通往奥兹国的钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the key to Oz.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.15,0:00:45.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,有很多神奇的方法可以进入奥兹国\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are magical ways into Oz …
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.57,0:00:47.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这把钥匙能把任何一扇关着的门\N{\fnArial\fs30}This key will turn any locked door.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.31,0:00:48.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,变成前往奥兹国的传送门\N{\fnArial\fs30}into a portal to Oz.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.67,0:00:50.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你来不来啊 - 去奥兹国吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You coming or what? - To Oz?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.08,0:00:51.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 你说想要来一场历险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. You said you were looking for adventure.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.70,0:00:53.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,机会来了 小红毛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, here it is, red.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.24,0:00:56.91,Note,0,0,0,0,,（如今）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.07,0:01:35.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.44,0:01:38.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我别的都不知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I don't know anything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.18,0:01:41.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 我还是要折磨你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. I'm gonna torture you anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.34,0:01:45.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁不喜欢折磨人呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause who doesn't love a little torture?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.60,0:01:52.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,[邪恶力量 第10季第11集]
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.14,0:01:57.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 随时告诉我消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, well, just… just keep me posted, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.15,0:01:58.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 好嘞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.97,0:02:00.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 小卡 还在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, Cass. You there?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.51,0:02:02.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, thanks. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.38,0:02:07.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做了蛋白蛋饼吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You made egg-white omelettes?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.78,0:02:09.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 最棒的早餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Breakfast of Champions…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.16,0:02:10.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,对你这样的书呆子而言\N{\fnArial\fs30}you know, if you're a dork like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.60,0:02:13.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 而且你今天一直睡到7点 - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And you slept past 7:00? - Yeah, well,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.02,0:02:14.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到我们查明该隐血印的去除方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}until we get answers on this Mark of Cain,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.47,0:02:17.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要12步修身养性 避免堕落\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am on a 12-step program not to backslide.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.61,0:02:18.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 12步修身养性 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- 12 steps? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.69,0:02:21.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果该隐能做到带着血印生活而不被黑化\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, if Cain found a way to live with it after going dark side,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.70,0:02:23.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我也得想办法克制冲动\N{\fnArial\fs30}then I just got to find a way to keep it in check,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.30,0:02:25.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 我这一周都没喝酒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}so haven't had a drink in a week,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.12,0:02:26.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,每晚睡8小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}eight hours of rack time every night,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.91,0:02:29.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有这道杰作\N{\fnArial\fs30}and…now this masterpiece.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.67,0:02:30.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才三步\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's three steps.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.47,0:02:31.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴吃你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up and eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.20,0:02:40.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,做得好棒啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow. That's… that's awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.49,0:02:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,烂死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.59,0:02:45.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ugh. God.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.04,0:02:47.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我一去掉这个恶魔荡妇纹身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soon as we get rid of this demonic tramp stamp,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.93,0:02:51.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就要回归饮酒 吃汉堡 再饮酒的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am back on the booze, burgers, and…more booze.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.94,0:02:53.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我你有发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me you got something.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.97,0:03:19.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.10,0:03:21.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,该隐还是克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cain or Crowley?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.22,0:03:23.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,查理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.17,0:03:26.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,她从奥兹回来了吗 居然没打电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is she back from Oz? She didn't call?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.05,0:03:27.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.64,0:03:28.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,她很忙啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's been busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.42,0:03:35.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell am I looking at?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.76,0:03:39.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在查阅新闻\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you know, I was looking into the news,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.90,0:03:41.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,找有什么古怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}checking for anything weird, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.08,0:03:43.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,发现了一则关于一男子被折磨的新闻\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found this story about a torture vic.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.30,0:03:44.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,他邻居家的小孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apparently, some kid videotaped this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.61,0:03:45.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,拍下了这一幕\N{\fnArial\fs30}at his next-door neighbor's house.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.96,0:03:48.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么 查理折磨了别人\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you saying, Charlie tortured someone?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.50,0:03:49.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们那个查理吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our Charlie?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.41,0:03:50.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,小不点 连霍比特人都不忍伤害\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yea high, wouldn't hurt a Hobbit,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.76,0:03:52.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,呆萌可爱的那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}practically sparkles?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.35,0:03:57.74,Note,0,0,0,0,,（本地地检官遭人折磨）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.93,0:03:59.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,查理 接电话啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Charlie, pick up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.59,0:04:01.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个被她折磨的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The guy she went all Jack Bauer on…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.28,0:04:02.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫彼得·哈珀\N{\fnArial\fs30}uh, Peter Harper.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.58,0:04:03.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不接\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's not answering.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.65,0:04:05.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,是托皮卡的地检官\N{\fnArial\fs30}District attorney in Topeka.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.99,0:04:06.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,根据文章所述\N{\fnArial\fs30}According to this article,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.77,0:04:09.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不是当地唯一遇袭的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}he wasn't the only person in town that was hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.09,0:04:12.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,前一晚 一名法庭速记员遭到了袭击\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, a court stenographer was assaulted the night before.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.32,0:04:14.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,查理绝不会无缘无故袭击人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you know, Charlie wouldn't go off on someone without a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.58,0:04:15.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也这么认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I wouldn't think so either,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.55,0:04:17.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但你看那段视频啊 - 我看了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- but look at the video. - Oh, I'm looking at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.59,0:04:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们的所作所为 如果不明真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you know what we do, taken out of context,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.30,0:04:21.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,看上去也会这么糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}it doesn't look that much different.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.27,0:04:22.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,她或许在猎魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}She could be hunting.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.13,0:04:26.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去跟这混蛋谈谈 看看怎么回事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't we go talk to this asshat and see what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.58,0:04:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.64,0:04:49.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗯 我们上路吧 - 我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. Yeah, let's do this. - Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.01,0:04:54.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,袭击发生前 你发现什么怪事了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, did you notice anything odd before the attack…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.79,0:04:57.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪味儿 异响\N{\fnArial\fs30}any, uh, strange smells, weird noises?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.92,0:04:58.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.97,0:05:01.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是在家 准备上床\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just at home here, getting ready for bed,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.78,0:05:04.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个疯婆子就袭击了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that crazy bitch jumped me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.75,0:05:06.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,她只想打听一桩\N{\fnArial\fs30}All she wanted was to know was about some case.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.36,0:05:08.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我多年前的案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I worked on years ago…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.57,0:05:10.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,醉驾司机拦腰撞上另一辆车\N{\fnArial\fs30}drunk driver T-boned another car,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.68,0:05:11.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,撞死司机\N{\fnArial\fs30}killing the driver,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.73,0:05:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,副驾被当场宣布脑死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the passenger was declared brain-dead on the scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.91,0:05:16.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,米德尔顿夫妇\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Middletons.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.58,0:05:18.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们有个12岁的女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}They had a daughter, 12 years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.13,0:05:19.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们当时正开车去接她\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were on their way to pick her up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.36,0:05:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 你怎么知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's right. How did you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.29,0:05:22.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们联调局会调查\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we do our homework at the FBI.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.63,0:05:25.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你就该知道 那案子根本没上过法庭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, well, then you know the case never went to trial.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.65,0:05:27.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我连证据都没见着 案子就被撤下了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before I could even see the evidence, it was off the books.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.82,0:05:29.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,案卷全部封存了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the files were sealed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.03,0:05:30.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这怎么可能呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, how is that even possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.79,0:05:31.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.89,0:05:32.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我今早又查了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I looked into it this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.96,0:05:35.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那宗案子的记录哪都找不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no record of that case anywhere,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.29,0:05:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,施行逮捕的警官此后也已过世\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the arresting officer has since passed away.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.01,0:05:39.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么都没有了 除了这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing, except for this…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.44,0:05:42.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,米德尔顿女孩的社保档案\N{\fnArial\fs30}the social service file on the Middletons' kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.69,0:05:45.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,老实说 没什么用处\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not very helpful, to be honest with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.30,0:05:47.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,那孩子早失踪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The kid has disappeared,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.66,0:05:48.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}until now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.61,0:05:53.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于案子 你还记得其他任何事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, is there anything else you can remember about the case…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.84,0:05:56.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 任何人 - 没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- any names you can think of? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.22,0:05:59.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟警察也说了 那是很久以前了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like I told the police, it was so long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.18,0:06:00.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.75,0:06:03.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.55,0:06:05.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.33,0:06:08.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们过来的时候 去找了另一位受害人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We talked to the other victim on the way here…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.43,0:06:09.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个速记员\N{\fnArial\fs30}the stenographer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.15,0:06:11.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说袭击者直到她给出了一个名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, she said the attacker didn't let her go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.97,0:06:13.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,才肯放她走\N{\fnArial\fs30}until she gave up a name…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.67,0:06:15.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.17,0:06:17.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.91,0:06:19.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,那这跟我在我家中\N{\fnArial\fs30}But w-what does that have to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.05,0:06:21.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,遭袭有什么关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}with m-me being attacked in my own home, here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.89,0:06:23.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你给出了谁的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}What name did you give up?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.22,0:06:26.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟警察说的话 我都告诉你们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I told you everything I told the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.53,0:06:28.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这女人闯进来 把我打得半死\N{\fnArial\fs30}This woman comes in here, beats the tar out of me,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.85,0:06:30.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我已经没什么人可以供出了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but… but there's no name to give up,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.03,0:06:31.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我也不知道该…\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I-I don't know what else to…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.48,0:06:32.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, w-what are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.75,0:06:33.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,老实交待 你个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talk, you son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.93,0:06:35.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才是受害的一方啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, look, I'm the victim, here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.29,0:06:36.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,交待\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talk!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.40,0:06:40.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.87,0:06:42.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.51,0:06:44.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.45,0:06:56.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,案卷被封之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}After the files were sealed…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.25,0:06:59.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去问过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I pushed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.31,0:07:01.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.44,0:07:03.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们给了我不少钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}They offered me money… a lot of money.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.89,0:07:05.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,说名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me a name.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.01,0:07:07.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些钱一直是从海外账户汇来\N{\fnArial\fs30}The money kept on coming in from overseas accounts.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.22,0:07:09.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 说名字 - 我会被取消律师资格的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Give me a name! - I will be disbarred!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.22,0:07:13.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是你最不该担心的事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That'll be the least of your worries,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.49,0:07:15.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promise you that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.08,0:07:26.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,芭芭拉·科迪议员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Councilwoman Barbara Cordry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.28,0:07:36.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,西莱斯特·米德尔顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Celeste Middleton.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.89,0:07:41.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,西莱斯特 那是查理的真名\N{\fnArial\fs30}Celeste… that's Charlie's real name.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.40,0:07:46.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来她是在找害她家毁人亡的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess she's looking for the person who, uh, destroyed her family.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.61,0:07:48.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能怪她吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you blame her?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.07,0:07:53.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得找到她\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, we just got to find her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.04,0:07:56.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,免得她做什么没法回头的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}before she does something nobody can walk away from.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.63,0:08:14.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,芭芭拉·科迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Barbara Cordry?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.17,0:08:16.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,有事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.01,0:08:17.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我是盖布利尔特别探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. I'm Special Agent Gabriel.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.67,0:08:19.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位是我搭档 科林斯特别探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my partner, Special Agent Collins.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.46,0:08:20.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,能进去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}May we come in?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.61,0:08:22.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么事啊 - 我们有几个\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's this about? - We have some questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.54,0:08:24.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于一起多年前的醉驾事故案子的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}about a drunk-driving case from a while back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.15,0:08:26.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,当事人是米德尔顿夫妇\N{\fnArial\fs30}involving the Middleton family.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.54,0:08:29.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道你们在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no idea what you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.00,0:08:31.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 女士 可否… - 抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ma'am, if we could just… - Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.32,0:08:32.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还在休假\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm still on vacation.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.16,0:08:35.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,请跟我的助手定个预约吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feel free to schedule an appointment with my assistant.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.91,0:08:37.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,她会为你们安排的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She'll pencil you both in.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.37,0:08:44.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有问题 - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Guilty much? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.56,0:08:57.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,甘蓝是什么鬼啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is kale?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.71,0:08:59.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,「反权威\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Anti-authority disorder,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.19,0:09:01.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,临床抑郁 暴力发作「\N{\fnArial\fs30}clinical depression, violent outbursts."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.01,0:09:04.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 查理真是… - 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Charlie was, uh… - Dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.13,0:09:06.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们那个年纪被心理医生审核了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If a shrink interviewed us at that age,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.67,0:09:09.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果难道会是温馨美好的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}you think the report would be all kittens and rainbows?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.55,0:09:10.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.33,0:09:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是个好姑娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's a good kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.71,0:09:14.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一切肯定是有原因的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's got to be an explanation for this, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.02,0:09:15.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's just got to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.88,0:09:44.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,就该知道{\u1}火箭{\u0}和{\u1}格鲁特{\u0}会找到我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should have known Rocket and Groot would track me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.97,0:09:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,放了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let her go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.87,0:09:48.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.80,0:09:51.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,她吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, her?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.74,0:09:55.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别这样 - 我只想要答案\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't do this. - I just want answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.99,0:09:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗 你什么开始为找答案伤人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah? Since when do you start pounding on people for those?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.40,0:09:59.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在奥兹遇到了什么啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell happened to you in Oz?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.91,0:10:01.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想要的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything I wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.13,0:10:03.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,冒险\N{\fnArial\fs30}An adventure.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.22,0:10:07.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,还弄到一把短剑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even got my own little sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.83,0:10:08.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,查理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.41,0:10:11.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 你真可爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Sam, you're adorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.39,0:10:12.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你不会伤害我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not gonna hurt me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.88,0:10:15.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上 你的问题就在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact, that's your problem…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.00,0:10:19.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,总那么有原则 从不伤人\N{\fnArial\fs30}all good-guy code, no bite.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.16,0:10:21.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是浪费\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a waste.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.70,0:10:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.27,0:10:26.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,总是让他拖累你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always letting this albatross hold you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.90,0:10:28.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, all right, you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.61,0:10:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道这是什么情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what's going on here, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.70,0:10:33.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你不是这样的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But this… this is not you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.97,0:10:35.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, it's me, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.37,0:10:37.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,查理 把刀放下 放她走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie, put the knife down. Let her go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.13,0:10:38.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不想伤害你 丫头\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't want to hurt you, kiddo,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.97,0:10:40.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们不会让你这么做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we're not gonna let you do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.03,0:10:48.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.49,0:10:53.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.35,0:11:07.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.33,0:11:08.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You all right? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.96,0:11:10.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她跟你说什么了 - 她就是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What did she say to you? - She… she just…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.44,0:11:12.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,她要银行对账单\N{\fnArial\fs30}she wanted the bank statements.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.30,0:11:21.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,查理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.19,0:11:30.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你个混蛋丫头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.69,0:11:37.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's up, bitches?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.38,0:11:46.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.94,0:11:50.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得跟你们说说情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um we should probably catch up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.37,0:12:06.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,有两个你 一个好 一个坏\N{\fnArial\fs30}There two of you… one good, one…bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.02,0:12:08.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,忍者混蛋版的你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, what, dick you is some sort of a ninja?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.98,0:12:10.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的确很厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}She is a badass, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.42,0:12:11.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 等等 倒回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}O-okay. Hold on. Back up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.96,0:12:14.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,桃乐西 奥兹 黄砖路 这我们都知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were there for Dorothy, Oz, yellow brick road.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.69,0:12:15.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,后来呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}B-but then…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.83,0:12:16.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,战争\N{\fnArial\fs30}War.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.93,0:12:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,翡翠城之战\N{\fnArial\fs30}The war for Emerald City.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.37,0:12:21.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,很酷炫\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.15,0:12:24.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,但后来就不酷炫了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until not so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.77,0:12:25.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要输了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were gonna lose,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.98,0:12:28.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,于是我做了个交易 跟…\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I made a deal with the wizard…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.54,0:12:30.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥兹的巫师\N{\fnArial\fs30}of Oz.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.54,0:12:32.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,兜帽加恐怖面具\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wears a hood and a creepy mask,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.65,0:12:34.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,挺混蛋 好愉快啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}kind of a jerk… good times.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.47,0:12:35.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说我们如果想赢\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said for us to win,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.45,0:12:38.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得释放内心真正的阴暗面\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to unleash my true darkness,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.65,0:12:40.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是比喻哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}which he meant literally.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.34,0:12:42.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,他用了奥兹的内心钥\N{\fnArial\fs30}He used the inner key of Oz.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.59,0:12:46.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,开启了灵魂之门 把阴暗面放出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It opens a door to your soul and lets the darkness out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.82,0:12:50.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的身体还有联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, we're still connected physically.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.81,0:12:52.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你们伤害她 也会伤到我\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you hurt her, you hurt me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.41,0:12:55.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,但总之 她是坏人 我是好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But bottom line, she's bad, and I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.36,0:12:57.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And let me just tell you,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.07,0:12:59.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,做好人 真是烦人\N{\fnArial\fs30}being good is really annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.38,0:13:00.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,一般在这种地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Normally in a place like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.43,0:13:02.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会大肆饮酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd be pounding Harvey Wallbangers.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.46,0:13:04.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,看酒保美臀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and checking out the bartender's ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.50,0:13:07.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我现在只想喝苏打水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now all I want to do is sip club soda.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.88,0:13:09.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,送她去上大学\N{\fnArial\fs30}and send her to college.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.52,0:13:13.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 好查理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, uh…good Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.25,0:13:17.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么黑暗查理为什么一心复仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, why is dark Charlie gunning for revenge?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.65,0:13:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是想赢回我的心\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's trying to win me back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.58,0:13:22.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑暗查理一个人就赢下了战争\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dark Charlie won the war single-handedly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.68,0:13:23.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.63,0:13:27.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,她做了些很糟糕的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}She did some truly awful things.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.98,0:13:28.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉她\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I told her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.67,0:13:31.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我再也不想靠近她了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't want any part of her near me again, ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.33,0:13:34.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,她去找那些…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Going after the person who mur… mur… uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.95,0:13:37.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,夺走我父母的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}who took my parents away.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.35,0:13:40.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,是她表明我们有多亲密的变态方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}is her messed-up way of showing me how close we are,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.81,0:13:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者说她认为我们可以多亲密\N{\fnArial\fs30}or… or could be.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.42,0:13:47.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直说「她」 但她就是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I keep calling her "she, " but she's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.59,0:13:50.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我做了这些事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the one doing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.65,0:13:52.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,查理 那不是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie, that… that's not who you are, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.86,0:13:54.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,那只是一个变态版本的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's… it's a twisted version of…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.96,0:13:55.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.69,0:14:00.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直在跟踪她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been following her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.35,0:14:02.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,想趁她干下蠢事前拦下她\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I can catch her before she does something stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.29,0:14:05.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后永远把她关起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}a-and just lock her away forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.17,0:14:06.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,查理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, Charlie…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.66,0:14:08.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not an answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.59,0:14:09.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.47,0:14:11.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得回奥兹去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll go back to Oz,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.22,0:14:15.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,去混蛋巫师那里拿钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we'll… we'll get the key from the wizard of douche,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.50,0:14:16.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后把你们拼回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we'll put you back together.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.73,0:14:18.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算我想要跟她合并\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even if I did want her back…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.38,0:14:20.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,看啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.72,0:14:23.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑暗的我弄坏了钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}dark me broke the key.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.12,0:14:26.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没办法去找巫师了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no way to get back to the wizard.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.68,0:14:29.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,一步步来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, okay, first thing's first.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.42,0:14:30.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得先找到黑暗查理\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to find dark Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.51,0:14:32.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶在她找到醉驾司机之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}before she finds the drunk driver.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.63,0:14:35.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们知道芭芭拉给出了她当年的银行账单\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, we know Barbara gave up her old bank statements, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.78,0:14:37.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么黑暗查理大概会追随资金\N{\fnArial\fs30}That means dark Charlie will probably follow the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.92,0:14:40.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,找当初付钱的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}back to whoever made the payoffs.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.81,0:14:42.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就会这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I would do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.83,0:14:43.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.05,0:14:45.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我再去续一杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get some refills.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.79,0:14:47.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need you…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.47,0:14:50.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑入芭芭拉的银行账户\N{\fnArial\fs30}to hack into Barbara's bank accounts.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.42,0:14:54.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.52,0:14:56.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 那样太坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - It's bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.90,0:14:59.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我说了 做好人很烦人的 - 这样呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I told you… being good is annoying. - How about this…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.69,0:15:01.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你教教我怎么做 行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}how about you guide me through the process,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.88,0:15:03.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样使坏的就是我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then I'm the bad one?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.99,0:15:32.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 芭芭拉的钱都来自海外账户\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so, Barbara's payments all came from offshore accounts,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.38,0:15:34.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,用傀儡公司掩盖来源\N{\fnArial\fs30}which were routed through dummy corporations,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.85,0:15:36.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,而这些公司都破产了\N{\fnArial\fs30}which have all gone belly-up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.76,0:15:38.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,直接跳到最后 龙纹身的男孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, skip to the end, dragon tattoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.52,0:15:40.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,最终都查到这人身上吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}They all lead back to this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.60,0:15:41.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗素·惠灵顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Russell Wellington.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.89,0:15:43.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,根据他的个人档案看\N{\fnArial\fs30}And according to his personal records,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.22,0:15:45.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,事故一周后\N{\fnArial\fs30}he had a-a car that was reported stolen.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.25,0:15:47.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他报失了一辆车\N{\fnArial\fs30}the… the week of the accident,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.24,0:15:49.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这辆车一直没被找到\N{\fnArial\fs30}a-a car that was never recovered.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.13,0:15:50.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,在所谓的「盗车」发生之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}And after the supposed "theft, "
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.76,0:15:53.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他去休假了两周\N{\fnArial\fs30}he went on a sabbatical from work for two weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.70,0:15:58.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,回到公司的时候 身上有淤青 脚踝也伤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and returned to work with bruises and a broken ankle.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.49,0:16:02.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this is him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.29,0:16:06.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这人…\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the man who, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.88,0:16:10.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,别看了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.31,0:16:11.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.82,0:16:14.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, dudes. Dudes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.89,0:16:16.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,秘密不是好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Secrets are bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.63,0:16:21.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,查理 我觉得你不该靠近\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie, I don't think you should be anywhere around.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.07,0:16:23.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个人渣推销员\N{\fnArial\fs30}this piece-of-crap salesman.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.15,0:16:26.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我觉得找到黑暗查理\N{\fnArial\fs30}And… and I don't think that finding dark Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.92,0:16:28.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,把她关起来不能解决问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}and locking her up is gonna work.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.48,0:16:31.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,她虽然黑暗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, she may be…dark,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.08,0:16:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,但她始终是你的一部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}but she's still a part of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.20,0:16:37.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.14,0:16:40.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽不中听 但是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate it, but you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.52,0:16:43.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我们去地堡吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Let's go to the bunker.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.41,0:16:45.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍姆用钥匙去了奥兹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baum used the key to Oz.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.12,0:16:48.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许记录者的档案里有关于钥匙的记录\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe there's something in the Men of Letters' files about the key.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.91,0:16:51.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们修好钥匙 就能回奥兹\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we fix it, we can get back to Oz.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.74,0:16:52.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 你们去弄那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, you guys dig into that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.70,0:16:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去盯着罗素\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna keep an eye on Russell.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.80,0:16:56.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,等着黑暗查理找上门\N{\fnArial\fs30}and, uh…wait for dark Charlie to show up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.42,0:16:57.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.03,0:16:58.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 或许该由我来…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, maybe… maybe I should be the one…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.64,0:17:00.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不 我行的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, no, no. I got. It's, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.94,0:17:02.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,真难以置信我还得…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just can't believe I have to…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.36,0:17:04.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,保护那个人渣\N{\fnArial\fs30}protect this piece of crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.36,0:17:05.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得保护他们两个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you got to protect them both.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.42,0:17:06.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果黑暗查理受伤了 那…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, if dark Charlie gets hurt, then…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.89,0:17:09.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也遭殃 小心哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}So do I, so…be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.54,0:17:12.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.09,0:17:20.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.02,0:17:26.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,路上跟你说 走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell you on the way. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.52,0:17:29.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,平静思绪的关键\N{\fnArial\fs30}The key to quieting your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.69,0:17:31.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是专心于平静\N{\fnArial\fs30}is minding your quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.44,0:17:35.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道并了解 缺乏答案…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Know and understand … the lack of an answer is …
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.56,0:17:57.39,Note,0,0,0,0,,（罗素·惠灵顿）
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.40,0:18:01.04,Note,0,0,0,0,,（惠灵顿地产开发）
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.70,0:18:27.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 找到了 克莱夫·狄龙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, here we go. Clive Dillon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.49,0:18:30.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是第一个发现通往奥兹国钥匙的记录者\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is the Man of Letters that first discovered the key to Oz.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.39,0:18:32.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,根据这个事故报告\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, according to this incident report,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.07,0:18:35.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莱夫去了奥兹国 但是把钥匙留在了人间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clive went to Oz, but he left the key on earth,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.11,0:18:36.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后李曼·弗兰克·鲍姆发现了钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then L. Frank Baum found the key.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.66,0:18:39.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,去奥兹国救克莱夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}and went to rescue Clive in Oz.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.27,0:18:40.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,桃乐西就是那时候偷偷溜进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's when Dorothy snuck along for the ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.67,0:18:42.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 被困在了里面 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- and got stuck there. - Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.06,0:18:44.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,在鲍姆救了克莱夫之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then after Baum rescued Clive,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.34,0:18:46.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莱夫回来退休了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clive came back and retired.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.99,0:18:48.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,做记录者能退休吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can retire from the Men of Letters?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.56,0:18:50.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,显然 他们把他安置在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, apparently, they put him in some sort of,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.72,0:18:53.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,类似证人保护计划下了\N{\fnArial\fs30}like, uh, witness-relocation program.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.57,0:18:54.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,他到哪去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did he end up?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.08,0:18:57.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来查清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.63,0:19:00.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,普雷斯利先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Presley?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.18,0:19:06.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,普雷斯利先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Presley?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.79,0:19:09.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Yeah. Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.56,0:19:10.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,实际上 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, actually, I'm, uh, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.61,0:19:12.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,正入神欣赏这篇…\N{\fnArial\fs30}really into this article on, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.35,0:19:16.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于乳房X线照片的文章\N{\fnArial\fs30}…mammograms.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.21,0:19:19.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常吸引人 如果其他人想去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Riveting stuff. If somebody else wants to go…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.48,0:19:23.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Yes. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.64,0:19:26.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.61,0:19:30.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位是普雷斯利先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Presley for you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.37,0:19:33.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天没别人了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that it for the day?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.26,0:19:35.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 先生 - 好 你可以走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, sir. - Okay. You can head out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.49,0:19:38.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我的干洗衣物送去湖边小屋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, I need my, uh, dry cleaning taken to the lake house,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.65,0:19:40.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,接上佩珀\N{\fnArial\fs30}and, uh, pick up Pepper.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.16,0:19:42.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,把她送去宠物美容师那里 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and take her to the dog groomers, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.44,0:19:44.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好的 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, sir. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.79,0:19:47.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,普雷斯利先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Presley.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.13,0:19:52.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗素·惠灵顿 请坐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Russell Wellington. Please have a seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.27,0:19:55.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.70,0:19:59.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能不能告诉我你今天要找什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What can you tell me about what you're looking for today?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.39,0:20:01.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 这个嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, right. Well, um…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.28,0:20:05.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我描述一下我的梦想住宅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me describe my dream home.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.25,0:20:09.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,记录者给了克莱夫一个新名字 新家\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Men of Letters gave Clive a new name, a new house,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.11,0:20:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这两个现在都还在记录中\N{\fnArial\fs30}both of which are still listed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.55,0:20:13.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得克莱夫可能还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think Clive might be still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.46,0:20:17.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,那他差不多 得有100多岁吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Y… well, he'd be, like, 100-something.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.68,0:20:19.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥兹国的时间不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time passes differently in Oz.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.89,0:20:21.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在附近 我们去看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's close by. Let's go look.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.68,0:20:23.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他还活着 他是唯一一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he's still kicking, he is the only person.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.32,0:20:25.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,有可能修好奥兹国钥匙的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}who might be able to fix the key to Oz.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.72,0:20:26.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧 我们走 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right, let's go. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.60,0:20:36.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是说我必须要按摩浴缸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not saying that I have to have a jacuzzi.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.55,0:20:40.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是说我真的很喜欢泡泡\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just saying that I really like bubbles.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.35,0:20:41.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,普雷斯利先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, Mr. Presley,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.63,0:20:43.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要打断你\N{\fnArial\fs30}look, I'm just gonna stop you right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.52,0:20:46.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,从你廉价的鞋子和褪色的牛仔裤来看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Judging from your cheap shoes and your faded jeans,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.59,0:20:47.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜你唯一\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm guessing the only house.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.67,0:20:49.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,有意购买的房子是带轮子的\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're in the market for comes with wheels.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.43,0:20:50.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我很忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, look, I'm a busy man.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.64,0:20:52.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的时间非常宝贵\N{\fnArial\fs30}My time is extremely valuable.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.61,0:20:55.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想让乡巴佬浪费我的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I prefer not to have it wasted by some hayseed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.86,0:20:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想卖我就想买\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm willing to buy if you're willing to sell.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.28,0:21:00.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不如你给我看看你有什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So why don't you show me what you got?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.37,0:21:03.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以带你去门口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I can show you the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.96,0:21:09.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为自己是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who the hell do you think you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.13,0:21:11.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是要救你命的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the guy who's gonna save your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.46,0:21:13.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.76,0:21:14.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,希尔橡树街\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hill and Oak Street.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.55,0:21:17.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,旅行车 里面有一男一女\N{\fnArial\fs30}Station wagon with a man and a woman in it,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.07,0:21:20.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,正赶去接参加睡衣派对的小女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}on their way to pick up their little daughter from a slumber party.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.84,0:21:21.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,想起来了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That ring a bell?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.62,0:21:25.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道你在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I-I-I don't know what you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.25,0:21:26.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你不知道 因为你喝得太醉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, you wouldn't, 'cause you were too drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.86,0:21:28.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不记得那晚任何事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}to remember anything that night.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.06,0:21:30.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得你把我当成别人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you have me confused with somebody else.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.34,0:21:31.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许是个在乎的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or somebody that cares.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.20,0:21:33.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许是个不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or maybe somebody who wouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.51,0:21:36.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,花钱让别人掩饰过失杀人的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}pay people off to cover up manslaughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.28,0:21:37.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.62,0:21:40.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.52,0:21:44.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,待在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.55,0:21:46.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要离开这房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not leave this room.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.11,0:22:03.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,查理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.29,0:22:08.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's talk about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.23,0:22:11.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们温彻斯特兄弟和你们的谈话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You Winchester boys and your talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.43,0:22:15.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,废话空话 被压抑的感情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blah, blah, blah, repressed feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.16,0:22:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等等等 被动攻击\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blah, blah, blah, passive aggression.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.49,0:22:20.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样 丫头 你不想这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, kiddo. You don't want to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.20,0:22:25.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想伤害他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to hurt him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.31,0:22:27.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想跟他聊聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.58,0:22:29.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 就像你和其他人那样聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, like you talked to all the others?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.82,0:22:32.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.98,0:22:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我失控了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got out of hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.05,0:22:39.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这从来和复仇无关\N{\fnArial\fs30}But this was never about revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.43,0:22:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.89,0:22:43.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想让他看到我的脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want him to see my face.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.84,0:22:48.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想让他看到他对我 对我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want him to see what he did to me…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.27,0:22:50.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.41,0:22:52.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,仅此而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.46,0:22:56.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.53,0:22:59.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我应得的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I deserve that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.17,0:23:05.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我们把他交给警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then we hand him over to the cops.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.65,0:23:17.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.26,0:23:25.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. …
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.75,0:23:32.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,西莱斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Celeste.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.34,0:23:37.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经很久很久没人这么叫我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one's called me that in a long, long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.46,0:23:46.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.12,0:23:49.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我所做的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I did … it…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.77,0:23:52.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我那时太年轻 太蠢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was young. I was stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.05,0:23:54.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我所夺走的 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I took, I…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.58,0:23:56.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我永远都无法补偿你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can never give back to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.02,0:23:59.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我在事故之后所做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what I did after the accident,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.43,0:24:01.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是万万不该\N{\fnArial\fs30}that never should have happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.28,0:24:02.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有喝醉\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I wasn't drunk for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.84,0:24:04.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我那时完全清醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was stone-cold sober.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.96,0:24:08.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是自私\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was selfish…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.28,0:24:10.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,是错误的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.20,0:24:14.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我该为此付出代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I should pay for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.88,0:24:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会为此付出代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I will pay for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.31,0:24:22.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你夺走了我的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}You took everything from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.85,0:24:25.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.55,0:24:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,西莱斯特 我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Celeste, I am so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.11,0:24:42.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗素\N{\fnArial\fs30}Russell?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.79,0:24:47.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我原谅你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I forgive you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.99,0:24:56.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,什…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wh…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.72,0:24:58.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,查理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.58,0:25:00.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,查理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.21,0:25:02.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要这么做 查理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't do this, Charlie!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.93,0:25:35.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.01,0:25:38.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,等下 我开免提\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hold on. I'm putting you on speaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.14,0:25:41.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.18,0:25:43.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.56,0:25:45.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,「结束了」什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean, "It's over"?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.41,0:25:48.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,她找到了罗素 杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}She got to Russell. She killed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.67,0:25:49.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.66,0:25:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,查理 如果你能听到 我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie, if you can hear me, I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.29,0:25:57.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是你的错 是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not your fault. It's mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.34,0:25:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不 别这么说 这不怪你\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. Don't … don't say that. This is not on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.80,0:26:01.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我们还是尽量按计划进行 各位\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, let's, uh … let's try and stick to the plan, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.39,0:26:03.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们找到办法回奥兹国了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you guys find a way back to Oz?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.27,0:26:06.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.02,0:26:09.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一个找到钥匙的记录者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, look, t-the Man of Letters who originally found the key …
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.02,0:26:10.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}he's still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.26,0:26:12.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他以迈克尔·卡特尔的名字住在强克逊城\N{\fnArial\fs30}He lives in Junction City under the name Michael Carter.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.82,0:26:14.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把地址发你 来和我们汇合\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll text you the address. Just come meet us.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.90,0:26:15.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我这就来\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. I'm on my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.62,0:26:28.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要一晚上都瞪着那玩意吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you gonna stare at that all night?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.09,0:26:31.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想慢慢来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm pacing myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.73,0:26:38.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,她好可爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.07,0:26:44.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你骗了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You lied to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.46,0:26:46.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你骗了自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}You lied to yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.62,0:26:48.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's kind of your move.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.82,0:26:51.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过你有点不对 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something's off about you, though, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.40,0:26:54.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们总是有情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's always something with you boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.44,0:26:57.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我犯过错误 但我会付出代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've made mistakes. But I'll pay for mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.30,0:26:59.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也会付出代价的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you'll pay for yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.52,0:27:00.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,得了吧 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.38,0:27:04.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是禽兽 他才是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not the monster here. He was.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.43,0:27:06.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他罪有应得\N{\fnArial\fs30}He got what he deserved.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.63,0:27:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I'm right.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.60,0:27:11.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道变黑暗让我发现了什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what I learned about being dark?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.07,0:27:13.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这让你自由\N{\fnArial\fs30}It sets you free.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.37,0:27:17.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你内心也知道我没说错\N{\fnArial\fs30}And part of you knows that's right, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.93,0:27:28.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.17,0:27:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莱夫·狄龙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clive Dillon?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.98,0:27:33.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我的名字是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. My name is …
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.62,0:27:34.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,迈克尔·卡特尔 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Michael Carter, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.22,0:27:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,但之前是克莱夫·狄龙 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it was Clive Dillon, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.43,0:27:40.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,还在做记录者时 在奥兹国时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back in the Men of Letters? Back in Oz?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.25,0:27:41.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们似乎搞错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You seem to be confused.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.57,0:27:43.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里没什么克莱夫·狄龙\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no Clive Dillon here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.86,0:27:45.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥兹国\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Oz?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.74,0:27:48.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,那只是童话故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's just a fairy tale.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.44,0:27:50.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该留在书架上的童话书\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's best left on the bookshelves where it belongs.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.77,0:27:53.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你从没见过这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you've never seen this before?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.38,0:28:07.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,请享用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enjoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.07,0:28:11.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,秀色可餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.16,0:28:13.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了 听好了 黑暗查理\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, listen, dark Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.45,0:28:15.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,成熟点吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, grow up.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.70,0:28:17.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有对错\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no right. There's no wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.80,0:28:20.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有我们和他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's just us… And them.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.61,0:28:24.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 没多久就不会再有你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, there's not gonna be a you for very much longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.91,0:28:28.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,小公主的我 是不是找到办法回奥兹国了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did princess me find a way back to Oz?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.36,0:28:29.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.79,0:28:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 一个退休了的记录者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, a former Man of Letters, retired,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.70,0:28:33.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,住在格兰镇 再过去两个镇就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}in Grantville, two towns over.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.85,0:28:36.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会修好通往奥兹国的钥匙 找到巫师\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're gonna fix the key to Oz, find the wizard,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.71,0:28:38.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你送回你该待的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}and put you back to where you belong.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.94,0:28:40.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,回到查理身体里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back into Charlie?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.69,0:28:43.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我该在那里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that where I belong?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.18,0:28:46.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.61,0:28:53.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走着瞧吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hm. We'll just see, won't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.13,0:28:56.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,在此期间\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the meantime…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.07,0:29:00.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你不请她跳舞\N{\fnArial\fs30}…if you're not gonna ask her to dance,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.96,0:29:03.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我就去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}then I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.53,0:29:29.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了 我的朋友三振出局了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened, did my friend strike out?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.13,0:29:30.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.62,0:29:32.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,她刚刚从后门离开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She just left out the back door.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.67,0:29:44.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.24,0:29:46.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个混蛋丫头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.88,0:29:49.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.88,0:29:54.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.42,0:29:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Where the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.83,0:29:59.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,混蛋查理刚刚偷走了我的宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dick Charlie just hot-wired baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.23,0:30:01.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,她以为她是去找你们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She thinks she's on her way to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.97,0:30:02.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.48,0:30:03.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉她的是错误的镇\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told her the wrong town,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.77,0:30:05.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以可能给你们争取了点时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I probably bought you a little time,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.49,0:30:07.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 注意点\N{\fnArial\fs30}but, uh, just be on the lookout.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.30,0:30:08.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一搞到车就尽快去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be there as soon as I can jack a ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.66,0:30:09.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks. Hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.83,0:30:15.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,有六把用奥兹国钢铁锻造的钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}The six keys of Oz were forged from Oz steel.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.54,0:30:18.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,只能在那片魔法领域被修复\N{\fnArial\fs30}They can only be repaired in that magical realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.14,0:30:21.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以没有办法回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}So there's no going back?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.10,0:30:24.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没法把我的黑暗面关起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't put my darkness away?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.13,0:30:26.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.46,0:30:28.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在奥兹国发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to you in Oz?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.84,0:30:30.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,都在报告里\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's in my report.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.16,0:30:31.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,报告里就说你被绑架了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your report just said you were kidnapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.14,0:30:32.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,被谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}By whom?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.25,0:30:35.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,坏人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bad people.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.47,0:30:38.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道这表情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know that look.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.10,0:30:41.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.01,0:30:42.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 说谎是… - 不好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And lying is … - Bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.89,0:30:44.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.07,0:30:48.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你所遭遇的事 亲爱的 我也遇到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to you, my dear, happened to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.23,0:30:49.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.98,0:30:52.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,一群巫师抓住了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}A coven of witches grabbed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.49,0:30:55.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在我身上使用了内心钥 释放了黑暗\N{\fnArial\fs30}They used the inner key on me, unleashed my ID.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.11,0:30:58.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他很可怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.43,0:31:02.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀死了所有的巫师 大发脾气\N{\fnArial\fs30}He killed all the witches and went into a tantrum.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.21,0:31:06.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,渴望权力 很疯狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was power-hungry, crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.21,0:31:09.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他变成了奥兹国巫师\N{\fnArial\fs30}He became the wizard of Oz.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.30,0:31:16.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗兰克的女儿 桃乐西 现在掌管翡翠城\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frank's daughter, Dorothy, runs Emerald City now.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.86,0:31:19.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,巫师 黑暗的你 他就在她身边\N{\fnArial\fs30}The wizard, dark you, he is right by her side.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.66,0:31:21.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果她有麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}If … if … if she's in trouble …
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.50,0:31:23.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有回到奥兹国的钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, without the key to Oz,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.77,0:31:26.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就没办法回到巫师那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's no way we can get back to the wizard.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.13,0:31:29.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.18,0:31:32.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许还有一个办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}There may well be a way…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.15,0:31:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,能把他召唤来\N{\fnArial\fs30}to summon him here.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.74,0:31:48.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我受到了致命的伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I am mortally wounded,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.32,0:31:50.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,他将不得不回到这里拯救我们二人\N{\fnArial\fs30}he'll have to come back here to save us both.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.51,0:31:54.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 一定还有别的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait, wait. There has to be another way.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.30,0:31:55.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,他所做的事都是我的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}What he has done is my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.79,0:32:00.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,毕竟 他是我 我是他 所以…\N{\fnArial\fs30}After all, he is me, and I am him, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.71,0:32:05.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我们俩该为我们的罪恶付出代价了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it's time that both of us answered for our sins.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.24,0:32:08.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是件好事 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the good thing to do, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.77,0:32:11.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.46,0:32:34.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜到你会给我假地址\N{\fnArial\fs30}I figured you'd lie about where to go to next.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.57,0:32:35.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,换我我就会这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I would do.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.62,0:32:37.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底想要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.32,0:32:39.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想和她谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want to talk to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.56,0:32:41.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你别想接近她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you're not going anywhere near her.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.34,0:32:42.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会让你腐蚀她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna let you corrupt her.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.85,0:32:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,腐蚀她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Corrupt her?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.10,0:32:45.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你再靠近一步 我就放倒你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You take one more step, I'm gonna put you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.46,0:32:48.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就爱这样的迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's the Dean I love.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.98,0:33:25.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干了什么 你个白痴\N{\fnArial\fs30}What have you done, you fool?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.69,0:33:45.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只有一个任务 活下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had but one task … stay alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.26,0:33:47.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你连这个都办不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you couldn't even manage that.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.47,0:33:56.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你出拳就像个不会打架的小女生一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hit like a girl who never learned how to hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.63,0:34:16.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这样 大个子 发泄出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it, big boy. Let it all out.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.01,0:34:26.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下来 拜托了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop this, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.56,0:34:27.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我帮帮我的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me help my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.65,0:34:31.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的朋友想当个英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your friend wanted to be a hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.15,0:34:33.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道英雄会有什么下场吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you know what happens to heroes?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.64,0:34:35.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They die.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.05,0:34:47.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你伤害了我的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hurt my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.44,0:34:49.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是和你学的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I learned it by watching you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.29,0:35:08.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.00,0:35:09.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我原谅你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I forgive you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.76,0:35:12.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都原谅你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We both do.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.43,0:35:33.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,查理 坚持住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie, hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.82,0:35:36.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.85,0:35:42.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean! Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.57,0:36:09.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做到了 是不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did it, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.27,0:36:13.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你杀了那个巫师\N{\fnArial\fs30}You killed the wizard.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.87,0:36:17.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.59,0:36:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你体内一直都有魔力\N{\fnArial\fs30}The magic was in you all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.22,0:36:25.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,西莱斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Celeste.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.69,0:37:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,查理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.39,0:37:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,查理 我在这儿呢 没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie. Hey. I got you. It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.35,0:37:17.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.54,0:37:48.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 他…好多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, he's, uh, he's better.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.89,0:37:51.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,他现在平静下来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, he's calmed down now.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.03,0:37:54.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡 我们得…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass, we got to …
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.09,0:37:56.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得找到该隐 或者…\N{\fnArial\fs30}we got to find Cain, or…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.81,0:37:59.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得找个办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}we got to find something, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.47,0:38:02.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.19,0:38:05.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 我知道 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I know. I hear you. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.06,0:38:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 知道了 谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got it. Yeah. All right. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.10,0:38:18.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是应该休息一下吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shouldn't you be resting up?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.48,0:38:22.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想连着睡两天应该够了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think sleeping for two days in a row is probably enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.65,0:38:27.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么…你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…are you…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.94,0:38:29.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 还是坏的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good? Bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.64,0:38:33.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想平衡我就满足了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I'll just settle for balanced.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.31,0:38:41.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于血印有什么发现吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything about the Mark?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.57,0:38:43.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许 我找到了本书\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, maybe. I found this book.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.38,0:38:45.53,Title,0,0,0,0,,是一本传说 《诅咒之书》\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a lore book … "The Book of the Damned."
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.93,0:38:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来蛮靠谱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds legit.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.80,0:38:48.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,在托斯卡纳的一栋图书馆里\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's in a library somewhere in Tuscany.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.03,0:38:50.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能什么也查不到 不过我想着…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It might be a dead end, but I figured…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.13,0:38:52.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去查查\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll go check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.95,0:38:55.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我没法回奥兹了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, there's no going back to Oz.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.79,0:38:58.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且巫师已经死了 桃乐西会好好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And with the wizard gone, Dorothy will be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.55,0:39:01.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么你不能再冒险了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, does this mean no more adventure?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.69,0:39:06.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想这儿的冒险就足够我们忙活了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we have all the adventure we can handle right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.17,0:39:07.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,那…\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about …
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.74,0:39:08.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑暗查理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dark Charlie?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.58,0:39:12.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,她…\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.07,0:39:15.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,很安静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.77,0:39:22.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得继续前进了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just got to keep moving forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.16,0:39:27.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都要这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all do.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.58,0:39:37.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,查理 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie, I…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.59,0:39:39.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要解决这件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are going to fix this.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.74,0:39:41.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能让发生在我身上的事也发生在你身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not letting what happened to me happen to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.60,0:39:43.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是已经发生了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's already happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.44,0:39:46.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 该隐找到了办法 - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Cain found a way to live with it. - Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.61,0:39:48.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,在经历了几个世纪的杀人之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, after centuries of murder.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.59,0:39:49.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.45,0:39:51.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一样东西你有他没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's one thing that you have that he didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.73,0:39:54.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.45,0:40:00.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我原谅你了 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I forgive you, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.97,0:40:04.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗 但是我没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.99,0:40:05.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.38,0:40:07.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's kind of your move.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.53,0:40:10.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,这对你有好处吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's that working out for you, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.41,0:40:17.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉 丫头\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so sorry, kiddo.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.08,0:40:24.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就证明给我看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then prove it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.09,0:40:46.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,在外头小心点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be careful out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.66,0:40:48.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这听起来像我的性格吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does that sound like either of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.22,0:40:50.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,假如我有所发现 我会打电话的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I find something, I'll call.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.87,0:40:51.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,假如没有…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If not…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.12,0:40:54.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会一直找下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll just keep digging.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.47,0:40:57.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,查理 谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.90,0:41:00.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,回头见 贱人们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Arrivederci, bitches.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.00,0:41:12.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You good?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.36,0:41:15.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.33,0:41:19.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说得没错 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's right, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.19,0:41:22.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能做到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.87,0:41:25.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能做到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.64,0:41:32.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们开始吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then let's get to work.
